====== AVM FRITZ!Box 7330 (SL) ======

A Lantiq AR9 based 802.11bgn ADSL2+ CPE with DECT and connectors for analog phones as well as 2 USB 2.0 ports. Also marketed as "FRITZ!Box 1&1 HomeServer".

Has similar hardware like [[toh:avm:avm_fritz_box_7320|AVM FRITZ!Box 7320]] - same Firmware can be used.

LAN1 (Atheros AR8035 1Gbit PHY) working.

LAN2 (Atheros AR8030-A, SK4P7.4D 1242 CN, 10/100 Mbps PHY) not working.

OEM source code available at: [[http://osp.avm.de/fritzbox/fritzbox-7330-sl/]]

