==== Status ====
Tested [[https://downloads.lede-project.org/releases/17.01.1/targets/lantiq/xway/lede-17.01.1-lantiq-xway-FRITZ7320-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin|LEDE-17.01.1.squashfs-sysupgrade.bin]].

  * Boot: working
  * Wifi: working - has to be enabled e.g. via LuCI, if not "reset to defaults" and reboot
  * Ethernet & DHCP: working
  * ADSL: not tested
  * Serial Port: working
  * LEDs: working
  * LuCI: working, "Flash Firmware" working
  * FIXME Please add DECT status here (DECT working? DECT not working?)
