Tested [[https://downloads.openwrt.org/chaos_calmer/15.05.1/lantiq/xway/openwrt-15.05.1-lantiq-xway-FRITZ7320-squashfs.image.eva|Chaos_Calmer-15.05.1.squashfs.image.eva]].

  * Boot: working
  * Wifi: Wifi output @Boot > no Wifi Section in Luci
  * Ethernet & DHCP: working
