  * LuCI: working, "Flash Firmware" did not work
  * Image [[https://downloads.openwrt.org/chaos_calmer/15.05.1/lantiq/xway/openwrt-15.05.1-lantiq-xway-FRITZ7320-initramfs.eva.align.128k|Chaos_Calmer-15.05.1.initramfs.eva.align.128k]] did not work due: ''<ERROR: FIRMWARE_ILLEGAL_CONFIG>'' @Boot.


