===== OpenWrt fixes =====
==== USB port power ====
The USB ports must be switched on by controlling the GPIO pins 50 and 51. Per default the powerlines are off and attached devices will not work.

Steps:
  * Copy the script gpiocontrol.sh from [[:docs:techref:hardware:port.gpio]]
  * ''sh gpiocontrol.sh 50 out 1'' and ''sh gpiocontrol.sh 51 out 1''
  * Now the USB ports are working. To do this automatically at startup add the two commands to ''/etc/rc.local''

==== Build/Enable SMP kernel ====

see: https://openwrt.org/toh/avm/fritz.box.wlan.7312#buildenable_smp_kernel

  * ''make menuconfig'' -> Target System: ''Lantiq'' -> Subtarget: ''XWAY'' -> Target Profile: ''AVM FRITZ!Box 7320'' -> Exit & Save
  * check/remove -> ''/openwrt/target/linux/lantiq/files/arch/mips/boot/dts/lantiq/ar9_avm_fritz7320.dts'' -> ''bootargs'' -> ''"nosmp"''

